 "translit": "", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "اَ۬لْغَٰبِرِينَۖ", "translit": "", "root": ""}], "narration": "warsh"}, {"surah": 15, "ayah": 61, "text": "فَلَمَّا جَآءَ ا۟لَ لُوطٍ اِ۬لْمُرْسَلُونَ", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَلَمَّا", "translit": "", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "جَآءَ", "translit": "", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ا۟لَ", "translit": "", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "لُوطٍ", "translit": "", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "اِ۬لْمُرْسَلُونَ", "translit": "", "root": ""}], "narration": "warsh"}, {"surah": 15, "ayah": 62, "text": "قَالَ إِنَّكُمْ قَوْمࣱ مُّنكَرُونَۖ", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "إِنَّكُمْ", "translit": "", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "قَوْمࣱ", "translit": "", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "مُّنكَرُونَۖ", "translit": "", "root": ""}], "narration": "warsh"}, {"surah": 15, "ayah": 63, "text": "قَالُواْ بَلْ جِئْنَٰكَ بِمَا كَانُواْ فِيهِ يَمْتَرُونَ", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالُواْ", "translit": "", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "بَلْ", "translit": "", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "جِئْنَٰكَ", "translit": "", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "بِمَا", "translit": "", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "كَانُواْ", "translit": "", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "فِيهِ", "translit": "", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "يَمْتَرُونَ", "translit": "", "root": ""}], "narration": "warsh"}, {"surah": 15, "ayah": 64, "text": "وَأَتَيْنَٰكَ بِالْحَقِّ وَإِنَّا لَصَٰدِقُونَۖ", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَأَتَيْنَٰكَ", "translit": "", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "بِالْحَقِّ", "translit": "", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "وَإِنَّا", "translit": "", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "لَصَٰدِقُونَۖ", "translit": "", "root": ""}], "narration": "warsh"}, {"surah": 15, "ayah": 65, "text": "فَاسْرِ بِأَهْلِكَ بِقِطْعࣲ مِّنَ اَ۬ليْلِ وَاتَّبِعَ اَدْبَٰرَهُمْ وَلَا يَلْتَفِتْ مِنكُمُۥٓ أَحَدࣱ وَامْضُواْ حَيْثُ تُومَرُونَۖ", "wor